      "created_at": "2026-10-12T10:25:58.166496+00:00"
    },
    {
      "id": "C03-S05-U13",
      "role": "client",
      "text": "嗯……行吧，那就不想了。\n\n……这周整体还挺平的，没什么特别卡的地方。",
      "call_id": "890757ad86094f0d9787876a8ae90d32",
      "response_id": "resp_d5a3e590-18cf-96b2-b0b0-b6eb8b73a0fc",
      "model": "qwen3.8-27b",
      "created_at": "2026-10-12T10:26:07.543263+00:00"
    },
    {
      "id": "C03-S05-U14",
      "role": "counselor",
      "text": "挺平的一周，你自己也感觉到了。那下次见。",
      "call_id": "fcd9b3ac0b514d4bbdb79598cae63706",
